Claro, mas eu mantive
meus padrões.

147
00:19:49,575 --> 00:19:51,199
Quero dizer...

148
00:19:51,200 --> 00:19:53,074
Supermercado?

149
00:20:00,658 --> 00:20:02,574
Holly, vá...

150
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:07,282
Isso...

151
